               V E N D O R    I N F O R M A T I O N
              --------------------------------------



This file provides information for Shareware Distributors, Disk
Vendors and BBS SYSOPs who wish to distribute SpyderT.


-----------------------------------------------------------------
                  Part 1:  Program Information:
-----------------------------------------------------------------

Program Name, Category, Keywords:
---------------------------------
   Name     - SpyderT
   Category - Psion3a (Hypertext Editor)
   Keywords - HYPERTEXT
              DATABASE
              PSION3A

Short Description:
------------------
    SpyderT provides the ability to create hypertext
    webs of text, and to search and report on the contents 
    of those webs.  Report output may be directed to particular
    cells within the web, to the screen, or (In the Registered
    Version) to text files in the Psion memory.

Longer Descrtiption:
--------------------------

    SpyderT provides the ability to create hypertext
    webs of text, and to search and report on the contents 
    of those webs.  Report output may be directed to particular
    cells within the web, to the screen, or (In the Registered
    Version) to text files in the Psion memory.

    Typical applications for SpyderT include:  hypertext notepad,
    freeform text database, outline processing, design tool,
    contingency planner, presentation planner and prompter,
    and help system host.

    When you pay the $19 SpyderT registration fee, you receive 
    a key to disable registration reminders and enable report
    output to Psion files.


    E-mail support for SpyderT is available at:

        71270.1441@compuserve.com
    and
        eieio@boulder.earthnet.net

-----------------------------------------------------------------
                Part 2:  Distribution Requirements
-----------------------------------------------------------------
The shareware version of SpyderT may be freely distributed,
with the following restrictions: permission must be received to
distribute SpyderT on retail racks, on CD Roms, or bundled
with any other product.

BBSs - please name the file SPYDRT.xxx.

When distributing SpyderT the following files must be distributed
together.

    SPYDERT.APP
    README.TXT
    VENDOR.DOC
    FILE_ID.DIZ
    CAVE.WEB
    QUOTES.WEB
    WEBSITES.WEB
    GRAMMAR.WEB
    
Disk Vendors, Shareware Distributors and BBS(s) may charge a nominal fee
for distribution of the program. The recipient of SpyderT must be informed,
in advance, that the fee paid to acquire SpyderT does not relieve the
recipient from registering his copy of SpyderT if he continues to use it.

